{"sandler": {"evergreen_strength": "Sandler Strong Evergreen (our agreement)", "upfront_commissions": "Transactions between 100-600 kW will be paid fees as a blended percentage inclusive of the higher percentage. Example: A 200 kW transaction fee will be paid at 18% for 0-99 kW and 13% for 100-200 kW. Transactions greater than 600 kW will be paid fees calculated as the greater of the 600 kW fee payment or 7% of total contract value.", "notes": "Commissionable Revenue excludes any non-recurring fees, one-time fees, setup fees, pass-through costs, power usage expenses that are strictly pass-through in nature, remote hands fees, and fees paid to third party providers, including telecommunications carriers.

For "All In kW" data center sales where power costs are not separately paid for, power usage expenses are estimated based on the following formula: direct usage cost based on 60% utilization plus a PUE factor of 50% of direct costs. "All In kW" means the sum of the monthly recurring space and power fees divided by total amount of power ordered (in kW). "All In kW" excludes cross connects, IP services, remote hands, carrier circuits or other data center services.

Register all new opportunities by filling out the Register a Deal form in order to be compensated on sales. Partners must stay actively involved in the sale, allowing no more than 30 days to respond to Element Critical's sales inquiries.", "pay_on_renewals": "Yes, 100% standard rate.", "commission_method": "Collected", "estimated_first_commission": null}}

